  "notes": "Dark IDE-like tool. Right canvas uses a faint dot grid (React Flow background) and colored dashed frames per signal type (Traces amber, Metrics sky-blue, Logs green) with solid colored tab labels with icons. Nodes are 146x97 cards: violet header (#8b5cf6 for receivers/exporters, indigo #6366f1 for processors) over a grey #30353d body with a single line icon (download/chip/upload). Editor and graph are linked: clicking a node highlights its YAML line and shows a path in the editor header. Primary buttons are indigo pills at 24px height. Validation popover combines a mode explanation with an accordion of collector distributions, each expanding to a version select + 'Validate against this version' CTA."
